    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jan 2026 12:52:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见大家o(*￣▽￣*)ブ，我们回来啦！本期我们分享了过去半年间的成长与变化，弥补过去半年彼此以及和听众朋友间的信息差。通过“年度40问”回顾了2025年的生活，通过我们的生活探讨，希望能够启发各位听众朋友们去找到属于自己的年度答案~</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 我们回来啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibaUsmUHc8z5QBXmE9KWyXcq1Et.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrC4MZPKSl_XHUZMhuav9wCnG_Yk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtrLHAs2jFHdxFrLql4wtjKQZmUU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqm0suqMLB7iA2RW2-KoI41YiX25.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📌小秀个人存公益心理咨询电话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjIgq7wru22ETJb_cGMXWXykG_6.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
