  <item>
    <title>029.小孩儿很容易开心，大人很容易不开心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68399ef631215eb50690539b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68399ef631215eb50690539b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 12:06:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>假期快乐！提前祝我们的电子朋友们端午安康，儿童节快乐~本期是高能量的一期节目，我们用童年高能量的自己来治愈长大后低能量的自己，原来我们的小时候这么有趣，干过这么多奇葩的事情，哈哈哈哈音量警告，高能爆笑ヾ(≧▽≦*)o</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 童年活动欢乐多，真想穿越回去再玩一次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 曾经无所畏惧的我，现在怎么被弄丢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 太丢人！活到现在也是真不容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 每个年代都有属于自己的“再来一瓶”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 没有小孩能拒绝毛茸茸的小动物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 童年恐怖事件！（尖叫预警）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 小时候的幻想真美好啊~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 我们再也不会因为考不好而“跳河”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 幸福幸福好幸福o(*￣▽￣*)ブ</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Gelato - Penguin's Game</span></p><span></span><p><span>👭</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他地方也有我们的身影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书、抖音：我在晚上晒太阳</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何向我们投稿你的故事：</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：356046604@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客平台|小红书|抖音私信也可~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客|小宇宙|喜马拉雅|网易云|荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有其他需求和建议可以在评论区和小红书留言我们~</span></p>]]></description>
