    <title>026.20岁的焦虑vs30岁的真相：职场暗箭、月光消费、整顿职场…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6801d96d1f1db84a560cdb53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6801d96d1f1db84a560cdb53</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>周五乐~本期小秀和小丁分别站在20岁群体和30岁群体的视角上来相互提问并作答。20岁的我们必然会对30岁抱有幻想和憧憬，期待自己变好变强大的那一天。同样30岁的我们对20岁也不少有遗憾，也对现在的20岁充满好奇。或许事情没我们想的那么简单，但是，请像期待你的20一样，期待你的30、40、50，也欢迎来到我的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> &nbsp;工作之后社交真的变少了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> &nbsp;00后怎么看待内卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> &nbsp;20岁会羡慕30岁人的生活吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a> &nbsp;哪些在20岁拥有的幻想在30岁破灭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> &nbsp;00后整顿职场，不止00后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> &nbsp;现在的年轻人是否会追求工作稳定，体制内or体制外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> &nbsp;工作之后的“勾心斗角”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> &nbsp;20岁幻想的30岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> &nbsp;误会part：工作之后的消费原来不是这样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> &nbsp;00后的婚育观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> &nbsp;30岁，正年轻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> &nbsp;30岁的你，对20岁的自己说两句吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>📌</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及节目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《第一人称复数》-大人笨，所以我不要变成大人</span></p><span></span><p><span>《燕外之意》-为什么现在的我们不谈恋爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span>👭</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他地方也有我们的身影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书、抖音：我在晚上晒太阳</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何向我们投稿你的故事：</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：356046604@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客平台|小红书|抖音私信也可~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客|小宇宙|喜马拉雅|网易云|荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有其他需求和建议可以在评论区和小红书留言我们~</span></p>]]></description>
