  <item>
    <title>023.武汉春日漫游指南：本地人私藏的3天深度路线+避雷清单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dd3fab78103db3bd032cc7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dd3fab78103db3bd032cc7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 10:34:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春天到啦，又是一年樱花季，相信不少小伙伴都想来武汉赏樱游玩，那么本期在武汉生活了十几年的小丁同学和上了三年学的小秀就想向大家推荐一些春天来武汉的旅游路线，以及一些推荐游玩吃喝的地方和我们的个人劝退指南~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 武昌区</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 武汉大学→湖北省博物馆/美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 东湖→植物园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 宝通寺→武商梦时代</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 江岸区、江汉区</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 古德寺→黎黄陂路→咸安坊→江汉路or江滩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> 选择江滩→大智路→黄鹤楼红墙打卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 过早！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 推荐：皮皮火锅，万松园（注意甄别）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3209">53:29</a> 浅浅劝退：黄鹤楼、昙华林、夏氏砂锅（褒贬不一）</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在这个季节正合适！欢迎大家来玩~</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他地方也有我们的身影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书、抖音：我在晚上晒太阳&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何向我们投稿你的故事：</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：356046604@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客平台|小红书|抖音私信也可~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客|小宇宙|喜马拉雅|网易云|荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有其他需求和建议可以在评论区和小红书留言我们~</span></p>]]></description>
